WEBVTT

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:29.270
<i>Yes, I felt we had no choice</i>
<i>but to accept the Church.</i>

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:34.780
<i>I can understand that.</i>
<i>After the frenzy the crowd flew into,</i>

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.740
not recognizing the Church
would have led to a riot.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:42.830
My life was saved as well.
There's no way that I could object.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:48.380
But I didn't expect that
there would be so many of them.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:52.210
Currently, our rough estimate
is that there are 5,000 of them.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.590
We're splitting them up and getting them
settled all over Anima-City.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.300
You've sure got it hard, Mayor.
Anyway, hang in there.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:01.890
What's the situation?

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.440
We've stabilized the inactivation
of beast deoxyribonucleic acid.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.600
We're almost there.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.480
I like it. Keep it up.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:12.860
HIROMU YABA

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:15.530
It's almost time for final confirmation.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:25.270
It was just three days ago that
the Church moved into that building.

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.680
It just goes to show you the power
of Silver Wolf.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:32.440
It proves the power of religious faith.

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.090
Nazuna?

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:02.970
Nazuna!

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.430
So you can fly too, Michiru?

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:09.810
Were you hiding it?

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:13.350
No! Yesterday was the first time!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.520
You didn't say you could fly either!

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:18.280
Do I have to tell you everything?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.990
You're the one who...

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:21.780
Oh, forget it!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.950
How could you move into the building
right across the street?

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:27.540
What? Boris made that decision on his own.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:31.410
Who cares about that?
Don't dare tell anyone who I really am.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.420
The fact that I'm a human
has to be kept secret.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.880
I told you I wouldn't tell anyone!

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:41.090
But is that what you really want, Nazuna?

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.640
I'm not Nazuna.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.140
I'm Déesse Louve!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.020
You see, I'm not Nazuna. I'm Déesse Louve.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.610
What language is that?

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.200
I can't remember that name.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:10.330
WE LOVE DÉESSE LOUVE

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:17.340
Where did you go?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:21.090
I was with Nazuna.
But that's not her name now.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:22.720
You went to see her?

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.640
I just happened to run into her.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.510
What? I can't do that?

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:30.010
No, you can.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.850
So what is it?

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.440
They're going to question
that falcon beastman that was arrested.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.440
Do you want to come?

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:46.660
I thought you might want to know
who hired him.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.700
That's why you called me here?

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.620
-Yes.
-Really?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:55.540
-If you don't want to, forget it.
-I'll go! I'll go with you!

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:02.380
Preaching religion to criminals
sure can't be easy.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:06.260
Criminals in particular
need the teachings of God.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.760
It's only natural.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.260
MEETING ROOM ONE

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.310
Good day.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.890
He was
the Medical Center facility director,

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.690
arrested for embezzlement.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:19.400
I doubt he will pull any rough stuff,
but be careful.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.110
I don't believe
in that Silver Wolf religion.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:28.530
Yes,
that's the kind of man you were, right?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.620
Wait. Have we met before?

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.000
I doubt you recognize me now.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.370
What?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.750
Shall I reveal your crimes?

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:45.760
I'm sure you plan on getting off
with mere embezzlement,

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:49.090
but I doubt Chairman Alan
will let you get away with it.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.560
Who the heck are you?

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.150
Isn't that...

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.730
That's the Church's chief mentor.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.700
Mr. Yaba, what's the matter?

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.200
Are you all right?

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.880
Oh, you're here too, Michiru?

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.590
Have you gotten used to this town?

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.630
Yes. Kind of.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.720
My, you seem unsure.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.890
Chief Inspector, Yaba is escaping!

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:42.190
That's Yaba?
He's totally different than before!

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:43.270
He sure is.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.150
You have permission to fire! Fire!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.080
Damn! How did he become so brutal?

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.830
I'll stop him!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.790
-What's that?
-There's a fire!

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:06.550
Yes, it's taken effect, just as expected.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.050
We can't let him do any more damage!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.130
He must be stopped!

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.970
He's smashed through the fence!
He'll get into the city!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:25.860
What?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.530
Shirou!

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.990
I'm good. I can handle this.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.740
But your arm!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.040
It's all better?

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.760
How can it resist even Ogami?

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.590
If that thing gets into the city,
there will be big trouble!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.020
-What are you doing?
-I'll take care of it!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:06.480
I'll carry him
to where there aren't any people!

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:09.110
-Don't be stupid! Get away!
-No!

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.940
Quit thinking you can do everything alone!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:16.450
When the chips are down,
I can do what needs to be done!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:27.130
Then show me what you can do!

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.550
Flap your wings harder!

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.430
<i>Harder!</i>

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.680
<i>Give me even larger wings!</i>

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.850
She's lifting that?

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:47.230
Quit struggling!

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:48.520
You bastard!

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:52.860
-The pier! There's nobody out there!
-Got it!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:00.540
-He's struggling again!
-Drop him!

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:03.410
-From this high up?
-I don't care! Just do it!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.160
-I'll be fine!
-Okay!

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.560
You did it!

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.060
Just barely.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.110
Get back!

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.570
Shirou?

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.740
I'll be fine. You get out of here.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.380
Shirou!

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:52.800
I'm fine.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.340
Not with a wound like that!
Let's get out of here!

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.930
I can't let that guy roam free.
That's my duty!

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.230
Stop it!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.610
Run!

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.180
I did it! Run for it, Shirou!

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.150
I've got no choice.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.020
Silver Wolf?

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.230
Wait! Aren't you Shirou?

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:35.400
Stand back.

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.100
Shirou!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.480
-I'll call an ambulance!
-Don't!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:16.440
-Why?
-I'll be all right.

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.780
Ogami!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.240
Mayor! What are you doing here?

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.160
Chief Inspector Tachiki told me
what happened.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.580
Shirou is...

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.410
He'll be fine.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.910
-Take him to the car.
-Right.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.340
She knows.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.720
I see.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.680
His condition has improved.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:53.770
His wounds have healed too.
He'll be fine now.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.940
That wound was so severe.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.020
He truly is immortal.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.150
Thank goodness
your injuries weren't any worse.

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:03.070
It's thanks to Shirou.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.030
What in the world is he?

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.950
Is Shirou Silver Wolf?

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.950
Isn't that who your friend is?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:16.670
Don't play dumb!
I heard him tell you earlier, "She knows."

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:20.840
Nazuna is a fake Silver Wolf.
You know that, right?

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:22.880
Yes.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.760
Is Shirou the real Silver Wolf?

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.430
What would you do if you knew?

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:35.600
I don't know anything about Shirou.

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.270
I didn't even try to find out.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:43.360
I must have decided somehow
that Shirou and I were different.

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.320
Since he's a beastman and you're a human?

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:52.950
Shirou hates humans, so I've always felt
kind of uncomfortable around him.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.960
I thought he was prejudiced, but...

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.670
I'm the same.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.880
I thought that since he's a beastman,
he and I were different.

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.630
I was frightened when I became a beastman.

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:13.470
That's probably because
I didn't know anything about beastmen.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:18.890
But now, I want to know more about Shirou.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:22.230
All right then.

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:27.440
Silver Wolf with wings, huh?

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:30.360
How incredibly mythological.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:36.370
The bigger the imitation,
the more ornate it's made to look.

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:42.130
The true Silver Wolf has been Shirou Ogami

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.250
since 1,000 years ago.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:45.960
A thousand years?

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.590
You mean, he's been alive for 1,000 years?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:52.340
-That's right.
-He doesn't look that old to me.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:57.980
He doesn't appear so. He hasn't aged
since he became Silver Wolf.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:14:59.980
He became Silver Wolf?

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:03.400
Ogami wasn't Silver Wolf from the start.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.940
It's a long story.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:16.240
<i>About 1,000 years ago, in the far east</i>
<i>of Europe was a city called Nirvasyl.</i>

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:21.370
<i>Like Anima-City,</i>
<i>only beastmen lived in that city.</i>

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:26.880
<i>He also lived there</i>
<i>as an ordinary wolf beastman.</i>

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:32.510
<i>At the time, the beastmen and humans</i>
<i>were on friendly terms</i>

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.850
<i>and everything was even between them.</i>

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.060
<i>But one day,</i>

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:43.060
<i>without any warning,</i>
<i>an army of humans attacked Nirvasyl.</i>

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.570
<i>His clan was murdered.</i>

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.580
<i>He was killed as well.</i>

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:17.100
<i>His body was abandoned</i>
<i>with all the others and left to rot.</i>

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.650
<i>That's when</i>
<i>a mysterious phenomenon occurred.</i>

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:50.670
The real reason behind it isn't known.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.260
But the blood of
his 2,000 Nirvasyl brethren

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:57.340
granted him an immortal body.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.760
That's what he believes.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:01.220
That's incredible.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:04.100
With his power as Silver Wolf,

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:07.350
he searched for the general
who murdered his clan.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:11.230
He chased after the human army
and killed many soldiers.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:15.150
<i>But he never found that general.</i>

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.750
<i>After realizing</i>
<i>the fruitlessness of vengeance,</i>

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:33.010
<i>he became the protector of beastmen.</i>

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:37.130
At times, he protects them
from human oppression.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.220
At times, he leads them
to a new promised land.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:43.100
That must be
how Silver Wolf legends started.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:46.020
He and I first met

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.060
in Europe at the end
of the Second World War.

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:56.320
<i>Some countries wanted</i>
<i>to analyze beastmen's abilities</i>

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.490
<i>to use as a biological weapon.</i>

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:01.530
<i>In those countries,</i>
<i>the beastmen were rounded up,</i>

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.410
<i>thrown into internment camps</i>
<i>and repeatedly experimented on.</i>

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:20.340
<i>We were rescued by Silver Wolf</i>
<i>at that time.</i>

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:27.680
<i>However, when he saw the wretched state of</i>
<i>the beastmen who'd been experimented on,</i>

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:31.480
<i>he massacred everyone</i>
<i>who worked in the research facility.</i>

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:37.240
<i>Ever since then,</i>
<i>he hasn't transformed into Silver Wolf.</i>

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:44.990
<i>Frightened by his own strength,</i>
<i>he's locked away the power of Silver Wolf.</i>

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.870
So don't tell anyone
that he is Silver Wolf. Understand?

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.590
-I don't understand.
-What?

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:59.510
I don't really understand,
so I will keep acting like I always have.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:03.390
To me, he is Shirou Ogami,

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:08.430
the gruff guy who fights desperately
to protect Anima-City.

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:10.770
That's right.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.110
That's the right thing to believe.
No, wait...

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.940
That's the way to be.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.030
Okay.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:23.450
As a survivor,
I strove to become a scientist.

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:29.160
I felt it was necessary to
learn about beastmen, not just humans.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.460
This was also
at that experimentation facility.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.460
He's a crow
that's been biologically modified.

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:39.010
That's why he's lived so long.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:43.760
We were both saved.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.140
I will remain silent.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:52.140
I swear I won't tell anyone
that Shirou is Silver Wolf.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.060
But...

00:19:55.150 --> 00:20:00.530
there's someone who I want to tell
that the real Silver Wolf exists.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:03.320
Please!

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.330
I don't know if he will agree.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:08.580
I don't care.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.120
Shirou!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.330
Go tell her.

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.750
Okay!

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:22.550
Are you sure?

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.090
Even if I stopped her,
she'd still tell her.

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:30.060
It sounds like you know her pretty well.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:32.560
She's given me plenty of trouble,
after all.

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:38.820
I need to go too.
There's something that's bothering me.

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.330
Michiru.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:04.130
-Well, Mayor.
-Show me the test results.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.800
-But--
-It's all right.

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:09.100
But...

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:12.680
You know full well
that before she was mayor of Anima-City,

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:16.310
she was the top
beast deoxyribonucleic acid researcher.

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:20.940
She's the first beastman
to obtain a doctorate.

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:25.860
What's with this transformation
in beast deoxyribonucleic acid?

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:28.370
Yes, we're trying to
figure that out as well.

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:32.290
Will you let me know
if you make any progress?

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.160
I'd gladly do that.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:38.250
It's very reassuring to have the head
of Sylvasta Pharmaceutical here.

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:41.250
Whatever may happen,
you're there to handle it.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.010
That's exactly why I'm here.

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:49.930
Yes, that's exactly why.

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:50.450
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
